    UnifiedThreadPool -.-> HTTP
    UnifiedThreadPool -.-> WebSocket
    UnifiedThreadPool -.-> Database
    UnifiedThreadPool -.-> SimplifiedEventSystem
    UnifiedThreadPool -.-> ServiceClient
    
    %% 🎯 简化事件系统集成
    SimplifiedEventSystem -->|local事件| UnifiedThreadPool
    SimplifiedEventSystem -.->|cross事件| ServiceClient
    
